    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** PLEASE EMAIL YOUR INQUIRIES ONLY - OFFICE UNABLE TO ACCEPT THE HIGH VOLUME OF CALLS ***\n\n12 Beau Park Crescent, Clongriffin, Dublin 13\n\nDescription\nSMART Property are delighted to present 12 Beau Park Crescent to the rental market, a well maintained and spacious three-bedroom house. This property is located in the highly sought-out residential area in Dublin 13. The rent currently set at ?3,300 per month, furnished and it is available immediately.\n\nUpon arriving, viewers will be instantly greeted with a spacious entrance hallway which leads you to the downstairs WC, kitchen and living space. The kitchen space is fully fitted with integrated appliances and offers ample amount of storage. The laminate cabinetry and tiled flooring provides a simple yet sleek design. Through the double doors, the living room offers a bright and cosy living area. The spacious living area continues with a grey colour scheme, a perfect setting to enjoy every day living and provides access to a south facing garden space, the perfect space to enjoy year-round. \n\nTaking the staircase to the first floor, the first floor comprises of two double bedrooms and the main bathroom. Both bedrooms feature built-in wardrobes, an abundance of natural light as well as ample floor space. One bedroom features an ensuite with a shower suite. The main bathroom comes with a bath and shower suite. The wooden floor theme continues throughout the whole property and leads to the master bedroom located in the converted attic of the property. The master bedroom offers a bright and spacious and features large windows allowing the room to flood with natural light. \n\nLocation\nBeau Park Crescent is within a stone?s throw away from a host of local amenities including Clarehall Shopping Centre, Donaghmede Shopping Centre and Northern Cross retail Park. The award-winning Father Collins Park offers children?s playgrounds, playing fields and a running track. The area is hugely popular with commuters due to the easy access to the city centre. The Dart station in Clongriffin is only 5 minutes? walk away. The No. 15 bus which is now a 24-hour bus service, also serves the property. The M1/M50 motorways and Dublin Airport are less than 15 minutes? drive from the property. \n\nViewings\nIf the photographs are anything to go by, this will be a property of interest to many and therefore early applications would be highly recommended to secure this rental property. Please feel free to contact the SMART office by email today. \n"
      },
